  "description": "Trust the Subvert HT5, a Plus hardtail designed to carry you with reliable ease through your wildest days. Start with a high-end 6061-T6 alloy frame engineered around 27.5\" Plus wheels, and the comfort and control of 3.0 Plus tires. Add a simple and effective 1x11 drive train featuring all new Shimano SLX 7000 components, a new FSA Comet 1x crankset, and a Suntour Raidon fork. A revamped Ritchey cockpit rounds out a component package that is light, effective, and all-day-durable.\n6061-T6 alloy Hardtail frame, 27.5\" Plus geometry, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 12x148mm Boost thru-axle dropouts\nMY17 SR Raidon RLR 27.5 Plus fork, tapered alloy steerer, 120mm travel, air spring, w/ remote lockout & Boost 15x110mm thru-axle\nNew FSA Comet Modular Boost crankset, 30T Megatooth Crmo Chainring\nNew Shimano SLX 7000 1x11-spd Shadow Plus rear derailleur & shifter\nNew Shimano SLX 7000 11-42T cassette\nRitchey Trail handlebar & seat post\nWTB Scraper 27.5\" Plus i40 rims w/ TCS i40 rim tape, Tubeless ready\nKenda Havoc 27.5x3.0\" tires, TCS, Aramid beads, 120 tpi\nShimano BR-M395 Hydraulic disc brakeset",
